WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.850
Let’s work one.

2
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:03.950
Follow the diagram.

3
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:09.050
You leave an eight hundred fix, steering zero four five true at eight knots.

4
00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:11.850
At ten hundred, where’s your DR?

5
00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:16.775
Two hours at eight knots: sixteen miles along zero four five.

6
00:00:17.025 --> 00:00:19.600
But your ten hundred fix isn’t there.

7
00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:25.225
It lies two point four miles from the DR, in the direction one two zero true.

8
00:00:25.475 --> 00:00:28.075
So the set is one two zero true.

9
00:00:28.325 --> 00:00:30.275
From DR to fix.

10
00:00:30.525 --> 00:00:32.075
And the drift?

11
00:00:32.325 --> 00:00:35.100
Two point four miles, in two hours.

12
00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:38.050
One point two knots.

13
00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:41.350
One more thing you can pull from the same picture.

14
00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:46.325
Draw a line from the eight hundred fix straight to the ten hundred fix.

15
00:00:46.575 --> 00:00:51.600
That line is what you actually did: your track, and your speed over the ground.
